---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-stone-200 bg-white mt-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ink-900 text-white font-bold text-xs">
            BN
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-ink-900">booxnet.com</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 max-w-xs">
          Inoffizieller Fan-Blog rund um ONYX BOOX E-Ink-Tablets und E-Reader.
          Nicht verbunden mit Onyx International Co., Ltd.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-400">
          * Affiliate-Links: Wir erhalten eine kleine Provision, die dir keine Mehrkosten verursacht.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-3">Inhalte</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-500">
          <li><a href="/blog?category=news" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">News</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?category=review" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">Reviews</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?category=comparison" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">Vergleiche</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog?category=guide" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">Guides</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 mb-3">Rechtliches</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-500">
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">Über uns / Disclaimer</a></li>
          <li><a href="/affiliate-disclosure" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">Affiliate-Disclosure</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-ink-900 transition-colors">Kontakt / Impressum</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-stone-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
        &copy; {year} booxnet.com – Inoffizielles Community-Projekt. Alle Markennamen sind Eigentum ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
        Kein offizielles Produkt von Onyx International Co., Ltd.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
